      <h1 id="page-heading">Bringing Damaged Teeth Back to Full Function</h1>
      <p class="hero-subhead">When teeth are broken, decayed, or structurally compromised, restorative dentistry rebuilds what's been lost — using techniques and materials chosen for durability, function, and appearance.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary btn-lg">Schedule a Consultation</a>
