<section class="section-white" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up" style="max-width:680px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">What We Provide</span>
      <h2 id="services-heading" class="section-heading">Restorative Services</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);">
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Dental Crowns</h3>
        <p>A crown covers a damaged tooth to restore its shape, strength, and appearance. Indicated for teeth that are cracked, severely decayed, or following root canal treatment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Dental Bridges</h3>
        <p>A bridge spans one or more missing teeth by anchoring to adjacent natural teeth or implants. A functional option when implant placement isn't the preferred path.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Implant Crowns</h3>
        <p>The visible portion of a single dental implant — a custom-fabricated crown matched to your surrounding dentition and placed once the implant has integrated.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Full-Mouth Reconstruction</h3>
        <p>When multiple teeth require treatment, a coordinated plan restores the entire bite — function, aesthetics, and long-term stability — in a thoughtful sequence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-light" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
