      <h2 id="approach-heading">Function First. Aesthetics Always.</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>Restorations at Foundation Dental Center are planned around how you bite and chew, not just how things look. A beautiful crown that creates bite imbalance is not a successful restoration.</p>
      <p>{{ site.doctorName }} evaluates the full occlusal picture — how your teeth come together, how forces distribute — before determining the best path for each case.</p>
